      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFrom the moment of arrival, this is a home that quietly captivates. A rare offering where thoughtful design, exceptional craftsmanship and an idyllic setting converge, it delivers a seamless blend of architectural distinction and genuine warmth. It is unusual to find a property that feels both strikingly individual and instantly welcoming. Here, that balance is achieved with effortless grace.\n\nThe approach is undeniably charming. Turning from the road into the sweeping driveway and arriving at the entrance gates, there is an immediate sense of occasion. Stone cottage-style buildings are beautifully arranged around a central courtyard, their striking red-framed windows creating a memorable, almost storybook first impression. The composition is both timeless and distinctive, a setting that feels private, characterful and complete.\n\nInside, the quality of finish is immediately apparent. Every detail has been carefully considered, from the stunning flooring and elegantly proportioned high ceilings to the dramatic timber-clad apex ceilings, which add architectural interest and warmth. The craftsmanship extends to the finer touches; bespoke ironmongery and solid wood kitchen cabinetry speak to a high level of attention, reinforcing the home's integrity and enduring appeal.\n\nThe interiors have been styled with impeccable taste. A thoughtfully curated selection of furniture, available by separate agreement, complements the architectural tone and enhances the sense of cohesion, comfort and understated luxury throughout.\n\nA defining feature of the home is its seamless connection to the outdoors. Each room enjoys direct access to the surrounding grounds, inviting natural light to flood the interiors and ensuring the landscape becomes an integral part of daily living. The principal suite is discreetly positioned at one end of the residence, offering privacy and tranquillity, while the kitchen, dining and living spaces form an exceptional central hub, perfectly designed for both relaxed family life and guest entertaining.\n\nThe gardens are equally enchanting. Rambling rose bushes climb one of the gables, while a mature privacy hedge provides shelter and seclusion. The adjoining field further enhances the setting, not only amplifying the sense of space but also offering protection against any future encroaching development, a valuable and reassuring feature.\n\nArchitecturally distinctive and finished to an exceptional standard, this courtyard residence offers privacy, craftsmanship and timeless style in equal measure. Beautifully presented and thoughtfully designed, it combines character and comfort with seamless indoor-outdoor living, creating a refined yet welcoming retreat perfectly suited to modern life.\n\nThe Gortnacooheen area near Portumna is renowned for its peaceful countryside setting and strong equestrian appeal. A key local amenity is the well-known Flowerhill Equestrian Centre, offering extensive cross-country riding, show jumping facilities, stabling, and scenic hacking routes across approximately 250 acres.\nThe area also benefits from close proximity to Portumna Forest Park, Lough Derg marina & boating facilities, the River Shannon, golf courses, walking trails, and the cafes and restaurants of Portumna town, making it an attractive lifestyle location for country and equestrian buyers."
      },
